        "body": "## Outcome\n- adapts GraphSync replication effects to the existing CARv2 PackBlockStore\n- seals, catalogs, and CID-verifies a physical read-back before signing a receipt\n- signature covers block CID, replica identity, landing time, and pack CID\n- proves qualification using two identities and two independent CARv2 object stores\n- rejects forged pack-location receipts\n\n## Verification\n- clojure -M:test: 21 tests / 71 assertions, 0 failures\n- clojure -M:lint: 0 errors (one pre-existing CLJS unused-require warning)\n- npm run test:async: all green\n- npm run test:r2: Miniflare R2 all green\n\nThis proves physical CARv2 landing in independent stores and an R2-compatible driver; live multi-machine qualification remains separate.",
        "created_at": "2026-08-16T09:35:13Z",
